    {
      "fieldname": "help_html",
      "fieldtype": "HTML",
      "options": "<div class=\"text-muted small\"><p>Every template gets <code>doc</code> (the source document), <code>recipient_name</code>, <code>company</code>, <code>portal_link</code> and the standard Frappe jinja helpers (<code>frappe</code>, <code>frappe.utils</code>).</p><ul><li><b>Sales Invoice</b> / <b>Payment Reminder</b>: <code>doc</code> is the Sales Invoice. Also <code>outstanding</code>, <code>due_date</code>, <code>days_overdue</code>, <code>rule_label</code>, <code>property_unit</code>.</li><li><b>Payment Receipt</b>: <code>doc</code> is the Payment Entry. Also <code>allocated_invoices</code> (list of dicts with <code>invoice</code>, <code>allocated_amount</code>, <code>outstanding</code>).</li><li><b>Lead Follow Up</b>: <code>doc</code> is the Lead. Also <code>follow_up_date</code>, <code>days_overdue</code>, <code>lead_link</code>.</li></ul></div>"
